        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amateeka ku Butali Bulongoofu mu Basajja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.15.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.15.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'agamba Musa ne Alooni nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Mugambe abaana ba Isirayiri nti omusajja yenna bw'anaavangamu ebitonnya mu bitundu bye ebyekyama, ebimuvaamu ebyo binaabanga ebitali birongoofu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era lino ly'etteeka ery'obutali bulongoofu bwe obuleeteddwa ebyo ebimuvaamu: obanga bitonnya obutasalako, obanga birekeddaawo, bunaabanga obutali bulongoofu mu musajja oyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Buli kitanda omusajja oyo alina ebimuvaamu ky'anaasulangako kinaabanga si kirongoofu, ne buli kintu ky'anaatuulangako kyonna kinaabanga si kirongoofu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu yenna anaakwatanga ku kitanda ky'omusajja oyo naye anaafuukanga atali mulongoofu okutuusiza ddala akawungeezi, era anaateekwanga okwoza engoye ze n'okunaaba mu mazzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu yenna anaatuulanga ku kintu kyonna omusajja oyo alina ebimuvaamu kw'anaabanga amaze okutuula, anaafuukanga atali mulongoofu okutuusa akawungeezi, era anaateekwanga okwoza engoye ze n'okunaaba mu mazzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era omuntu yenna anaakwatanga ku musajja oyo alina ebimuvaamu, anaafuukanga atali mulongoofu okutuusa akawungeezi, era anaateekwanga okwoza engoye ze n'okunaaba mu mazzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusajja oyo alina ebimuvaamu bw'anaawandanga amalusu ku muntu omulongoofu, omuntu oyo anaafuukanga atali mulongoofu okutuusa akawungeezi, era anaateekwanga okwoza engoye ze n'okunaaba mu mazzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era n'amatandiiko gonna omusajja oyo alina ebimuvaamu kw'aneebagaliranga ganaabanga agatali malongoofu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "era n'omuntu anaakwatanga ku kintu ekirala kyonna ekinaabanga wansi w'omusajja oyo anaafuukanga atali mulongoofu okutuusa akawungeezi, era anaateekwanga okwoza engoye ze n'okunaaba mu mazzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu yenna, omusajja oyo alina ebimuvaamu gw'anaakwatangako nga tasoose kunaaba mu ngalo mu mazzi anaafuukanga atali mulongoofu okutuusa akawungeezi, era anaateekwanga okwoza engoye ze n'okunaaba mu mazzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekibumbe kyonna ekikozesebwa mu maka bwe kinaakwatibwangako omusajja oyo alina ebimuvaamu kinaayasibwanga, na buli ekikozesebwa mu maka eky'omuti kinaanaazibwanga mu mazzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Omusajja anaabanga alina ebimuvaamu bw'anaafuulibwanga omulongoofu, aneebaliranga ennaku musanvu ez'okufuulibwa omulongoofu; anaateekwanga okwoza engoye ze n'okunaaba omubiri gwe mu mazzi amayonjo agakulukuta, bw'atyo anaafuukanga mulongoofu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olw'omunaana kinaamusaaniranga okuddira amayiba abiri oba enjiibwa ento bbiri n'ajja awali",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.15.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.15.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu mulyango gw'Eweema ey'Okukuŋŋaanirangamu n'abikwasa kabona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabona anaabiwangayo, ekimu nga kye kiweebwayo olw'ekibi n'ekirala nga kye kiweebwayo ekyokebwa. Mu ngeri eyo kabona anaatangiririranga omusajja oyo olw'ebimuvaamu eri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.15.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.15.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Omusajja bw'anaavangamu amazzi g'obusajja anaateekwanga okunaaba omubiri gwe n'amazzi, era anaasigalanga nga si mulongoofu okutuusa akawungeezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli lugoye olwambalwa oba eddiba nga kuliko amazzi g'obusajja, binaateekwanga okwozebwa mu mazzi, era binaabanga ebitali birongoofu okutuusa akawungeezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusajja bw'aneebakanga n'omukazi, ne wabaawo amazzi g'obusajja agafulumizibbwa, bombi banaanaabanga mu mazzi agatukula, era banaabeeranga abatali balongoofu okutuusa akawungeezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amateeka ku Butali Bulongoofu mu Bakazi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Omukazi bw'anaavangamu omusaayi ng'empisa ye eya bulijjo eya buli mwezi bw'eba, anaabeeranga atali mulongoofu okumala ennaku musanvu, ne buli anaamukwatangako anaabeeranga atali mulongoofu okutuusa akawungeezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu bbanga eryo ng'omukazi oyo si mulongoofu buli kintu kyonna ky'anaagalamirangako kinaabanga ekitali kirongoofu, ne buli kintu kyonna ky'anaatuulangako kinaabanga ekitali kirongoofu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era buli anaakwatanga ku kitanda kye kinaamusaaniranga okwoza engoye ze, n'okunaaba mu mazzi, era anaabeeranga atali mulongoofu okutuusa akawungeezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli anaakwatanga ku kintu kyonna omukazi oyo ky'atuulako, anaateekwanga okwoza engoye ze n'okunaaba omubiri gwe mu mazzi, era anaabeeranga atali mulongoofu okutuusa akawungeezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe kinaabanga ekitanda oba ekintu ekirala kyonna omukazi oyo ky'anaabanga atuddeko, omuntu bw'anaakikwatangako anaabeeranga atali mulongoofu okutuusa akawungeezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusajja bw'aneebakanga n'omukazi oyo, omusaayi gw'omukazi ogumuvaamu ogwa buli mwezi ne gumutonnyako, anaabeeranga atali mulongoofu okumala ennaku musanvu; n'ekitanda kw'anaagalamiranga nakyo kinaabanga ekitali kirongoofu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Omukazi bw'anaavangamu omusaayi okumala ennaku nnyingi mu biseera ebitali ebyo ebya buli mwezi nga bwe kiba bulijjo, oba bw'anaavangamu omusaayi okumala ennaku ezisukka ku za bulijjo eza buli mwezi, anaabeeranga atali mulongoofu mu bbanga ly'anaamalanga ng'avaamu omusaayi, nga mu biseera bye ebya buli mwezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli kitanda ky'anaagalamirangako ng'omusaayi gukyamuvaamu kinaabeeranga ekitali kirongoofu, ng'ekitanda kye bwe kiba mu biseera bye ebya buli mwezi eby'okuvaamu omusaayi, era ne buli kintu ky'anaatuulangako kinaabanga ekitali kirongoofu nga bwe kiba mu biseera bye ebya buli mwezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli muntu anaakwatanga ku bintu ebyo anaabeeranga atali mulongoofu; kinaamusaaniranga okwoza engoye ze, n'okunaaba omubiri gwe mu mazzi, era anaabeeranga atali mulongoofu okutuusa akawungeezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye omukazi oyo avaamu omusaayi bw'anaafuulibwanga omulongoofu, aneebaliranga ennaku musanvu, N'oluvannyuma lwazo anaabeeranga mulongoofu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olw'omunaana kinaamusaaniranga okuddira amayiba abiri, oba enjiibwa ento bbiri n'ajja awali",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.15.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.15.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku mulyango gw'Eweema ey'Okukuŋŋaanirangamu n'abikwasa kabona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabona anaawangayo ekimu nga kye kiweebwayo olw'ekibi, n'ekirala nga kye kiweebwayo ekyokebwa. Mu ngeri eyo kabona anaatangiriranga omukazi oyo eri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.15.30",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.15.30"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olw'ekitali kirongoofu ekimuvaamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Bwe mutyo bwe munaakugiranga abaana ba Isirayiri balemenga okusemberera ebintu ebibafuula abatali balongoofu, balemenga okufa olw'obutali bulongoofu bwabwe okuboonoonyesa Eweema ya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.15.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.15.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eri wakati mu bo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ago ge mateeka ku musajja alina ebimuvaamu mu bitundu bye eby'ekyama, n'oyo avaamu amazzi g'obusajja;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne ku mukazi anaavangamu omusaayi ng'empisa y'abakazi eya bulijjo eya buli mwezi bw'eba. Amateeka ago ganaakwatanga ku musajja oba ku mukazi alina ebimuvaamu, ne ku musajja aneebakanga n'omukazi atali mulongoofu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
